'''Sanada Yukimura''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Sengoku Wargods Vajiras (Gacha Event)|Sengoku Wargods Vajiras]] gacha event. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.9 Update|Version 2.0.9]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.1 Update|Version 5.1]] increases his speed and attack power. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.4 Update|Version 8.4]].

