==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Sanada Yukimura was a part of another [[Cat Combo]] called [[The First Vajiras (Removed Combo)|The First Vajiras]].
*[[wikipedia:Sanada Yukimura|Sanada Yukimura]] is the name of a samurai who fought during the Sengoku period of feudal Japan. He is known as a leader in the [[wikipedia:Siege of Osaka|Siege of Osaka]], which finalized the Tokugawa shogunate's dominance and brought two centuries of relative peace that followed.

